{
  "duration": 58.579,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 1.279,
      "text": "So welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 1.759,
      "end": 3.559,
      "text": "It's time to solve one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.019,
      "end": 7.359,
      "text": "Now in this problem, a kite string is fifty meters long,"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.839,
      "end": 11.759,
      "text": "and this string makes an angle of thirty degrees with the ground."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.259,
      "end": 12.979,
      "text": "The question is"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.479,
      "end": 15.619,
      "text": "asking us to find the height of the kite."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.039,
      "end": 17.479,
      "text": "Just imagine a right triangle here."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.879,
      "end": 19.279,
      "text": "The string is the slant side,"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.68,
      "end": 21.459,
      "text": "so it is the hypotenuse."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.92,
      "end": 24.779,
      "text": "The height of the kite is the vertical side,"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.299,
      "end": 27.899,
      "text": "so it is the opposite side to thirty degree."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.579,
      "end": 31.539,
      "text": "For opposite side and hypotenuse, we use sine theta."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.899,
      "end": 34.899,
      "text": "Sine theta is equal to opposite side by hypotenuse."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.299,
      "end": 35.759,
      "text": "So here,"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.18,
      "end": 38.919,
      "text": "sine thirty degree is equal to height by fifty."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.419,
      "end": 42.319,
      "text": "We know that sine thirty degree is equal to one by two."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.779,
      "end": 45.779,
      "text": "So one by two is equal to height by fifty."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.259,
      "end": 50.819,
      "text": "After cross multiplying, height is equal to fifty multiplied by one half."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.199,
      "end": 52.919,
      "text": "That gives us twenty-five meter."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.719,
      "end": 57.319,
      "text": "So the final answer will be twenty-five meter."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.68,
      "end": 58.579,
      "text": "Correct option is A."
    }
  ],
